{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"wangwei-p-e2ae1e9b0893e9","name":"荀!（底本字损）","evidence":["wangwei-q-c6af2def370461f67926"],"facts":[{"id":"wangwei-f-6546d387e7d1934f7ae1","text":"底本作荀!，称尚书仆射；不据官名或常识擅补为其他人。","evidence":["wangwei-q-c6af2def370461f67926"]}],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wangwei-q-c6af2def370461f67926","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-6e2a0cb5e2fa5caa6253","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝五﹞《傅子》曰：“初，李丰与嘏同州，少有显名，早历大官，内外称之；嘏又不善也，谓同志曰：‘丰饰伪而多疑，矜小失而昧于权利，若处庸庸者可也；自任机事，遭明者必死。’丰后为中书令，与夏侯玄俱祸，卒如嘏言。嘏自少与冀州刺史裴徽、散骑常侍荀甝善，徽、甝早亡。又与镇北将军何曾、司空陈泰、尚书仆射荀!、后将军钟毓并善，相与综朝事，俱为名臣。”","attribution":"裴注引《傅子》","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":556,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4ac2f131b83cb66d08f5","start":0,"end":167,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
